<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 70.2290 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 70.2290 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 70.2290 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 70.3592 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 23		  Oct 22</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     70.2290		 70.3592</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	     3.790		  10.465</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 46.7150		 46.0750</p>
<p> volume (DM million)	    0.040		   0.010</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
